  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 750eb (Expensive)<br><strong>Type:</strong> Armor Attachment (Body/Head Armor with an Armor Penalty)<br><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p>Needs a DV17 Basic Tech check to install and can't be removed. +3 SP (automated) and +1 to the Armor Penalty. A second set adds another +3 SP, +1 to the REF penalty, and +2 to the DEX and MOVE penalties; more sets do nothing. Example: Heavy Armorjack (SP 13, -2) becomes SP 16 at -3, then SP 19 at -4 REF and -5 DEX/MOVE. Raise the armor's penalty by hand.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>Armor Enhancement rules: one Enhancement per piece of armor (armor worn on both body and head counts as one piece); not for cyberware armor (Skinweave, Subdermal Armor) or armor that's part of an ACPA or vehicle; SP limits use the armor's fully repaired SP; a Tech installs or removes one in 1 hour with no check; they don't count as Tech Upgrades for Upgrade Expertise. Armor Attachments have no limit per armor unless stated.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Armor &amp; Fashion &gt; Armor Enhancements &amp; Kits).</em></p>"
